39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: I have not yet reviewed the delivery records, but I suspect the delays stem from external dependencies rather than internal execution.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Asuka, that retention pattern is encouraging. It suggests the underlying business models are resilient, which is what we need.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
