45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Asuka, you are right. If we cannot verify the figures, our confidence is built on sand.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Servas, exactly. Field instruments and moving goods give us verifiable data; pure software relies on self-reported dashboards.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Servas, the reserve data confirms my fear. Follow-on calls are hitting us at twice the modelled rate.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
