50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: @Minako, that is a serious strain. We must ensure our credit line can absorb these unexpected calls without breaking.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"- **Asuka**: @Minako, that aligns with my findings. We need to know if our current security structure supports that borrowing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Asuka, precisely. The credit line ignores subscription contracts, leaving us exposed when follow-on calls spike.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Minako, that sounds dire. I found recruiters fill support roles fast, but shift supervisors take four months.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
